menu "CLAW Matter bridge"
    config CLAW_MATTER_BRIDGE_GPIO_ALLOWLIST
        hex "GPIO allowlist bit mask"
        default 0x21C00000003C30
        help
            Mask of GPIOs available to CLAW-created devices. Select GPIOs
            that are free and permitted for the target board; exclude pins
            reserved for system peripherals or other hardware owners.
endmenu
